      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046531">AVX512_VBMI OR AVX10.1<anchor id="+498188"/></para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046533">Permute bytes in zmm3/m512 and zmm1 using byte indexes in zmm2 and store the byte results in zmm1 using writemask k1.</para>
